{"video_id":"WksAqIZ9PFA","title":"Platform Engineering 2.0: Just-Enough Kubernetes and AI-Native DevOps - Shweta Vohra, Booking.com","conference":"kubecon","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"supa","timing":"exact","word_count":3523,"segments":[{"start":0.48,"duration":3.4,"text":"Platform engineering"},{"start":4.16,"duration":3.76,"text":"is everywhere right now."},{"start":8.2,"duration":7.56,"text":"Everyone has a platform"},{"start":11.4,"duration":4.36,"text":"and everyone seems to be building one."},{"start":15.8,"duration":6.32,"text":"But the most uncomfortable question is"},{"start":20.0,"duration":4.52,"text":"are we all really talking about the same"},{"start":22.12,"duration":2.4,"text":"thing?"},{"start":24.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"As they say"},{"start":26.24,"duration":5.08,"text":"the map is not your territory."},{"start":29.52,"duration":3.24,"text":"Just because we call something as"},{"start":31.32,"duration":4.28,"text":"platform"},{"start":32.76,"duration":6.48,"text":"it doesn't mean it'll start working"},{"start":35.6,"duration":5.36,"text":"behaving like one the other day."},{"start":39.24,"duration":3.2,"text":"And that's why today I want to talk with"},{"start":40.96,"duration":5.64,"text":"you"},{"start":42.44,"duration":6.12,"text":"what platform engineering really means"},{"start":46.6,"duration":3.6,"text":"why do so many"},{"start":48.56,"duration":3.04,"text":"uh organizations struggle with the"},{"start":50.2,"duration":3.68,"text":"platform"},{"start":51.6,"duration":4.72,"text":"and what platform engineering 2.0 looks"},{"start":53.88,"duration":2.44,"text":"like."},{"start":57.52,"duration":4.92,"text":"Hi everyone. I'm Shweta Bora. I'm lead"},{"start":59.84,"duration":5.08,"text":"architect with booking.com"},{"start":62.44,"duration":4.52,"text":"where I build and scale"},{"start":64.92,"duration":4.6,"text":"platform ecosystem"},{"start":66.96,"duration":4.4,"text":"that works on highly distributed and"},{"start":69.52,"duration":4.8,"text":"real-world environment."},{"start":71.36,"duration":5.6,"text":"And the best part of my job is that it"},{"start":74.32,"duration":5.36,"text":"really enables millions of travelers"},{"start":76.96,"duration":5.4,"text":"across the world."},{"start":79.68,"duration":4.28,"text":"Now, over the years"},{"start":82.36,"duration":4.28,"text":"I have seen"},{"start":83.96,"duration":5.0,"text":"and worked with platform teams where"},{"start":86.64,"duration":4.52,"text":"they have poured their hearts into"},{"start":88.96,"duration":5.24,"text":"building platforms"},{"start":91.16,"duration":4.76,"text":"but still users and developers find it"},{"start":94.2,"duration":4.12,"text":"difficult to use."},{"start":95.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"I have felt that frustration because"},{"start":98.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"when something is meant to be"},{"start":100.2,"duration":6.0,"text":"simplifying things"},{"start":102.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"but it adds to the complexity."},{"start":106.2,"duration":5.44,"text":"On other hand"},{"start":108.04,"duration":5.76,"text":"I have also worked with platform teams"},{"start":111.64,"duration":4.68,"text":"where platform"},{"start":113.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"just works."},{"start":116.32,"duration":3.8,"text":"And suddenly teams"},{"start":118.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"move faster"},{"start":120.12,"duration":4.6,"text":"and take better decisions."},{"start":122.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"And this talk is"},{"start":124.72,"duration":4.08,"text":"actually coming from those moments"},{"start":127.24,"duration":2.8,"text":"of building,"},{"start":128.8,"duration":4.76,"text":"breaking,"},{"start":130.04,"duration":3.52,"text":"and rebuilding platforms."},{"start":133.64,"duration":3.32,"text":"Now, let me share with you something"},{"start":135.16,"duration":3.96,"text":"which I have seen coming over and over"},{"start":136.96,"duration":4.56,"text":"again."},{"start":139.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"A few months ago, I was working with"},{"start":141.52,"duration":4.56,"text":"four different teams."},{"start":144.32,"duration":5.04,"text":"Each of them told me that they have a"},{"start":146.08,"duration":5.16,"text":"platform, but when I looked underneath,"},{"start":149.36,"duration":6.12,"text":"I found that they all of them are"},{"start":151.24,"duration":4.24,"text":"talking about entirely different things."},{"start":155.96,"duration":5.12,"text":"While none of them were wrong,"},{"start":158.84,"duration":6.12,"text":"but let's test it together because I'm"},{"start":161.08,"duration":6.24,"text":"sure you must have also be seen that."},{"start":164.96,"duration":4.56,"text":"So, tell me how many of you have seen"},{"start":167.32,"duration":5.8,"text":"this."},{"start":169.52,"duration":5.32,"text":"We are using 80 plus open source tools."},{"start":173.12,"duration":5.12,"text":"We have a platform."},{"start":174.84,"duration":3.4,"text":"Anybody who has seen this?"},{"start":178.64,"duration":3.48,"text":"Okay."},{"start":180.32,"duration":3.8,"text":"Let's test this."},{"start":182.12,"duration":5.4,"text":"We built a developer portal. We are"},{"start":184.12,"duration":3.4,"text":"platform engineering team."},{"start":187.6,"duration":5.6,"text":"Okay, more hands going up. Nice."},{"start":191.48,"duration":3.08,"text":"How about this? Kubernetes is our"},{"start":193.2,"duration":2.64,"text":"platform."},{"start":194.56,"duration":3.32,"text":"Or"},{"start":195.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"we renamed DevOps"},{"start":197.88,"duration":4.0,"text":"to platform engineering, the classic"},{"start":199.96,"duration":3.72,"text":"one."},{"start":201.88,"duration":4.04,"text":"Wow."},{"start":203.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"And the interesting thing is"},{"start":205.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"none of them are entirely wrong,"},{"start":209.28,"duration":4.6,"text":"but none of these"},{"start":211.36,"duration":4.12,"text":"even help us telling that what platform"},{"start":213.88,"duration":4.4,"text":"engineering really means for them or"},{"start":215.48,"duration":2.8,"text":"what it is."},{"start":218.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"So,"},{"start":220.8,"duration":3.88,"text":"what we need to do is before we go to"},{"start":222.6,"duration":4.36,"text":"platform engineering 2.0, we need to"},{"start":224.68,"duration":4.0,"text":"establish a baseline."},{"start":226.96,"duration":4.88,"text":"Because platform is certainly not"},{"start":228.68,"duration":6.16,"text":"collection of tools."},{"start":231.84,"duration":6.76,"text":"Then what is?"},{"start":234.84,"duration":5.84,"text":"To establish that by baseline,"},{"start":238.6,"duration":5.24,"text":"I would say if"},{"start":240.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"platform is something which elevates you"},{"start":243.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"with stability,"},{"start":245.72,"duration":5.0,"text":"clear integration,"},{"start":247.96,"duration":4.64,"text":"and consistency."},{"start":250.72,"duration":3.84,"text":"If it does that,"},{"start":252.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"it's a platform."},{"start":254.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"If it doesn't do that,"},{"start":256.6,"duration":6.04,"text":"it's just another piece of technology"},{"start":259.24,"duration":3.4,"text":"often unfinished."},{"start":263.64,"duration":4.76,"text":"Now, let's make it real with two"},{"start":265.56,"duration":2.84,"text":"examples."},{"start":268.48,"duration":3.92,"text":"Take Netflix. Over the years, Netflix"},{"start":271.28,"duration":2.36,"text":"has"},{"start":272.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"given"},{"start":273.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"on one side their viewers the experience"},{"start":276.12,"duration":4.96,"text":"of movies,"},{"start":278.24,"duration":4.36,"text":"um series, or various other content what"},{"start":281.08,"duration":3.48,"text":"they release."},{"start":282.6,"duration":4.52,"text":"On other side,"},{"start":284.56,"duration":4.24,"text":"they have enabled"},{"start":287.12,"duration":3.48,"text":"through internal capabilities the"},{"start":288.8,"duration":3.08,"text":"creators"},{"start":290.6,"duration":3.52,"text":"and the"},{"start":291.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"partners vendors who hook up their"},{"start":294.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"content on their platforms without"},{"start":296.0,"duration":4.56,"text":"knowing the underlying complexities."},{"start":298.96,"duration":3.2,"text":"Definitely over the period of time they"},{"start":300.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"would have just scaled from movies to"},{"start":302.16,"duration":5.8,"text":"much broader ecosystem, but you'll never"},{"start":305.48,"duration":4.56,"text":"hear them saying that we have 100 plus"},{"start":307.96,"duration":3.04,"text":"tools. Rather, you'll hear them saying"},{"start":310.04,"duration":3.72,"text":"that"},{"start":311.0,"duration":5.68,"text":"we have experience and we have"},{"start":313.76,"duration":2.92,"text":"capabilities."},{"start":317.32,"duration":4.56,"text":"Now, because we are technical audience,"},{"start":319.04,"duration":5.96,"text":"let's take another example."},{"start":321.88,"duration":4.8,"text":"Take Linux or any other operating system"},{"start":325.0,"duration":3.48,"text":"which you appreciate, which is one of"},{"start":326.68,"duration":4.32,"text":"the oldest and most foundational"},{"start":328.48,"duration":3.52,"text":"platforms we have."},{"start":331.0,"duration":2.6,"text":"Now,"},{"start":332.0,"duration":3.52,"text":"Linux"},{"start":333.6,"duration":4.56,"text":"over the years has"},{"start":335.52,"duration":6.4,"text":"consistently worked for the vendors, be"},{"start":338.16,"duration":6.28,"text":"it cloud providers or um enterprise"},{"start":341.92,"duration":4.52,"text":"ecosystem or any other new platforms who"},{"start":344.44,"duration":4.16,"text":"build on top of it."},{"start":346.44,"duration":4.08,"text":"Because it is so much integratable,"},{"start":348.6,"duration":5.4,"text":"that's why people were able to build on"},{"start":350.52,"duration":5.64,"text":"top of it and it just worked."},{"start":354.0,"duration":5.28,"text":"Not because"},{"start":356.16,"duration":5.92,"text":"that it is fancy or complex or has many"},{"start":359.28,"duration":5.0,"text":"many tools underlying it."},{"start":362.08,"duration":5.04,"text":"And that's why"},{"start":364.28,"duration":6.44,"text":"we are using it even till date as the"},{"start":367.12,"duration":6.12,"text":"core for many many things. As simple as"},{"start":370.72,"duration":4.32,"text":"my platform, uh my laptop which is"},{"start":373.24,"duration":3.08,"text":"showing this presentation and it's"},{"start":375.04,"duration":4.6,"text":"working."},{"start":376.32,"duration":3.32,"text":"Unless until I jinx it."},{"start":380.68,"duration":6.24,"text":"So, the big question in the room"},{"start":384.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"what platform engineering is? Platform"},{"start":386.92,"duration":3.96,"text":"engineering is the discipline of"},{"start":388.72,"duration":4.12,"text":"building that platform"},{"start":390.88,"duration":5.16,"text":"which starts with"},{"start":392.84,"duration":5.48,"text":"core business domain."},{"start":396.04,"duration":4.96,"text":"At the bottom of this image, you see"},{"start":398.32,"duration":5.0,"text":"that one where core business need."},{"start":401.0,"duration":4.52,"text":"Because without having a goal or without"},{"start":403.32,"duration":5.12,"text":"having a purpose, you may build"},{"start":405.52,"duration":6.68,"text":"something useful but may not be platform"},{"start":408.44,"duration":6.08,"text":"or may not be of value to anyone."},{"start":412.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"Once you have that need defined, then"},{"start":414.52,"duration":3.68,"text":"you need to go and have your platform"},{"start":416.4,"duration":3.72,"text":"strategy"},{"start":418.2,"duration":3.44,"text":"and"},{"start":420.12,"duration":3.2,"text":"uh business models, which is very"},{"start":421.64,"duration":3.52,"text":"important because"},{"start":423.32,"duration":4.32,"text":"same thing these days you can serve"},{"start":425.16,"duration":4.8,"text":"through various business models."},{"start":427.64,"duration":4.08,"text":"You need to really decide that whom"},{"start":429.96,"duration":3.84,"text":"you're going to expose it to, how much"},{"start":431.72,"duration":4.0,"text":"you're going to expose it for, what the"},{"start":433.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"government's governance will look like"},{"start":435.72,"duration":4.28,"text":"and how would it evolve."},{"start":437.96,"duration":4.2,"text":"Once you have that clarity, then comes"},{"start":440.0,"duration":4.04,"text":"the experience and economization, which"},{"start":442.16,"duration":4.64,"text":"is the third part of this."},{"start":444.04,"duration":5.76,"text":"Now, I might be very much interested in"},{"start":446.8,"duration":5.84,"text":"giving my user base rocket science"},{"start":449.8,"duration":6.08,"text":"experience, but that may not be"},{"start":452.64,"duration":5.08,"text":"affordable operationable evolvable so"},{"start":455.88,"duration":3.2,"text":"I cannot give that. So, that's the place"},{"start":457.72,"duration":3.32,"text":"where you decide that what kind of"},{"start":459.08,"duration":4.48,"text":"experience is right for developers, what"},{"start":461.04,"duration":5.76,"text":"kind of of experience is right for other"},{"start":463.56,"duration":5.56,"text":"users. And based on that, you decide"},{"start":466.8,"duration":3.68,"text":"your technology strategy, then the tools"},{"start":469.12,"duration":3.68,"text":"come."},{"start":470.48,"duration":6.12,"text":"Then the things come that how this whole"},{"start":472.8,"duration":6.04,"text":"tools will work together and integrate."},{"start":476.6,"duration":4.36,"text":"And on top of that, you do your with"},{"start":478.84,"duration":3.48,"text":"that all base, you do your design and"},{"start":480.96,"duration":3.6,"text":"architecture."},{"start":482.32,"duration":3.6,"text":"And that then it comes to the whole"},{"start":484.56,"duration":3.16,"text":"circle of"},{"start":485.92,"duration":2.92,"text":"development and operations, which is"},{"start":487.72,"duration":3.56,"text":"often"},{"start":488.84,"duration":4.68,"text":"only part is understood as platform"},{"start":491.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"engineering."},{"start":493.52,"duration":4.44,"text":"Now, these are the six sides of the"},{"start":496.12,"duration":3.68,"text":"success blueprint."},{"start":497.96,"duration":5.52,"text":"And you need all of them to come"},{"start":499.8,"duration":5.92,"text":"together to build really useful"},{"start":503.48,"duration":3.92,"text":"And if you don't do that, you might"},{"start":505.72,"duration":3.08,"text":"still make something useful, but not a"},{"start":507.4,"duration":2.64,"text":"platform."},{"start":508.8,"duration":3.24,"text":"So,"},{"start":510.04,"duration":3.84,"text":"now I want to give you something really"},{"start":512.04,"duration":4.72,"text":"powerful."},{"start":513.88,"duration":5.24,"text":"It's the V Arise model."},{"start":516.76,"duration":5.2,"text":"It's a lens. Once you see it, you will"},{"start":519.12,"duration":6.0,"text":"never be able to unsee it."},{"start":521.96,"duration":4.72,"text":"And we will have a use case and a demo"},{"start":525.12,"duration":2.52,"text":"use case with it which we with which"},{"start":526.68,"duration":2.72,"text":"we'll"},{"start":527.64,"duration":5.36,"text":"prove it also."},{"start":529.4,"duration":6.32,"text":"This lens gives you these five"},{"start":533.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"parameters, which is adaptable"},{"start":535.72,"duration":3.6,"text":"because your platform has to be"},{"start":537.48,"duration":3.6,"text":"continuously evolving around your"},{"start":539.32,"duration":3.36,"text":"requirements, teams, and changing"},{"start":541.08,"duration":3.72,"text":"technology."},{"start":542.68,"duration":4.56,"text":"It has to be repeatable"},{"start":544.8,"duration":5.2,"text":"because this needs to be stability"},{"start":547.24,"duration":4.24,"text":"stability giving the stability and"},{"start":550.0,"duration":4.6,"text":"consumable"},{"start":551.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"in the same way for different contexts."},{"start":554.6,"duration":5.96,"text":"It needs to be integratable"},{"start":557.36,"duration":6.2,"text":"because without that, how will your"},{"start":560.56,"duration":7.36,"text":"teams, tools, workflows will hook up to"},{"start":563.56,"duration":4.36,"text":"that without getting that friction?"},{"start":568.12,"duration":4.84,"text":"It needs to have be self-sufficient"},{"start":570.8,"duration":6.56,"text":"because that's where you will provision,"},{"start":572.96,"duration":6.6,"text":"operate, and provide that value which"},{"start":577.36,"duration":4.16,"text":"should not require your platform"},{"start":579.56,"duration":4.4,"text":"engineers or platform teams to be"},{"start":581.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"present there to give that value."},{"start":583.96,"duration":3.12,"text":"Otherwise, that becomes a bottleneck."},{"start":585.56,"duration":3.36,"text":"So, it needs to be self-sufficient"},{"start":587.08,"duration":3.36,"text":"without having the platform teams being"},{"start":588.92,"duration":4.0,"text":"around."},{"start":590.44,"duration":3.76,"text":"And it should be"},{"start":592.92,"duration":4.56,"text":"uh uh"},{"start":594.2,"duration":6.32,"text":"ecosystem enabling. Because"},{"start":597.48,"duration":5.28,"text":"platforms are meant to be foundation."},{"start":600.52,"duration":5.16,"text":"These are not just systems."},{"start":602.76,"duration":5.32,"text":"These are ecosystem enablers where all"},{"start":605.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"things you do on top of it becomes"},{"start":608.08,"duration":4.56,"text":"another pattern innovation or many more"},{"start":610.64,"duration":6.6,"text":"things which come out of it."},{"start":612.64,"duration":6.6,"text":"Now, the catch-22 here is you will see"},{"start":617.24,"duration":3.76,"text":"and you need to have all five of these"},{"start":619.24,"duration":3.36,"text":"parameters to say that this is the"},{"start":621.0,"duration":4.08,"text":"platform."},{"start":622.6,"duration":5.48,"text":"Otherwise, if you get one, two, or three"},{"start":625.08,"duration":6.0,"text":"of these aspects and not all five, then"},{"start":628.08,"duration":3.0,"text":"something is missing."},{"start":631.6,"duration":5.6,"text":"Now, let's move on to platform"},{"start":634.36,"duration":5.24,"text":"engineering 1.0."},{"start":637.2,"duration":4.92,"text":"Platform engineering was born out of a"},{"start":639.6,"duration":6.12,"text":"need when organizations realized that"},{"start":642.12,"duration":5.84,"text":"they need to standardize infrastructure."},{"start":645.72,"duration":4.88,"text":"And that's where a lot of sophisticated"},{"start":647.96,"duration":5.4,"text":"stacks were built on top top of"},{"start":650.6,"duration":5.44,"text":"Kubernetes or along with Kubernetes."},{"start":653.36,"duration":4.0,"text":"Each of these tools or open-source"},{"start":656.04,"duration":4.2,"text":"projects"},{"start":657.36,"duration":6.08,"text":"brought something useful,"},{"start":660.24,"duration":4.8,"text":"but together they have created something"},{"start":663.44,"duration":4.36,"text":"different."},{"start":665.04,"duration":4.48,"text":"complexity."},{"start":667.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"So,"},{"start":669.52,"duration":4.28,"text":"more tools we adopted,"},{"start":671.8,"duration":3.76,"text":"more the complexity curve go grows"},{"start":673.8,"duration":3.24,"text":"because operational complexity grows"},{"start":675.56,"duration":4.92,"text":"with time."},{"start":677.04,"duration":6.08,"text":"And that's why platform teams became"},{"start":680.48,"duration":4.96,"text":"those teams who are just stitching all"},{"start":683.12,"duration":5.2,"text":"the time things around."},{"start":685.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"Because they have so much to stitch."},{"start":688.32,"duration":5.28,"text":"And that's where it lost somewhere in"},{"start":690.48,"duration":5.16,"text":"between. And the problem is"},{"start":693.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"the exposure model because everyone has"},{"start":695.64,"duration":4.76,"text":"exposure to Kubernetes and all the"},{"start":697.28,"duration":5.56,"text":"underlying details."},{"start":700.4,"duration":5.52,"text":"Now, in platform engineering 1.0"},{"start":702.84,"duration":4.56,"text":"workflow looks like this."},{"start":705.92,"duration":3.28,"text":"Developers"},{"start":707.4,"duration":4.0,"text":"write the configuration, the"},{"start":709.2,"duration":5.76,"text":"infrastructure configuration."},{"start":711.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"Platform translates it into cluster"},{"start":714.96,"duration":2.48,"text":"language"},{"start":716.2,"duration":3.2,"text":"and then"},{"start":717.44,"duration":3.76,"text":"Kubernetes gives you"},{"start":719.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"those capabilities and Kubernetes"},{"start":721.2,"duration":4.48,"text":"becomes the interface for developer."},{"start":724.16,"duration":3.2,"text":"Which is a problem."},{"start":725.68,"duration":4.4,"text":"Because you're exposing too much, which"},{"start":727.36,"duration":4.16,"text":"is not required."},{"start":730.08,"duration":2.96,"text":"Now, the shift in the platform"},{"start":731.52,"duration":3.08,"text":"engineering two"},{"start":733.04,"duration":2.48,"text":"comes is"},{"start":734.6,"duration":4.88,"text":"that"},{"start":735.52,"duration":7.24,"text":"developer expresses the intent"},{"start":739.48,"duration":6.4,"text":"and platform translates it into"},{"start":742.76,"duration":5.92,"text":"actions automatically."},{"start":745.88,"duration":4.92,"text":"And Kubernetes is still there"},{"start":748.68,"duration":3.6,"text":"as an engine, but it's not the"},{"start":750.8,"duration":2.84,"text":"interface."},{"start":752.28,"duration":3.88,"text":"And that's the shift we are talking"},{"start":753.64,"duration":2.52,"text":"about."},{"start":756.56,"duration":4.12,"text":"Just enough Kubernetes."},{"start":758.88,"duration":4.32,"text":"Which means"},{"start":760.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"you are deliberately choosing"},{"start":763.2,"duration":3.44,"text":"how much of Kubernetes you need to"},{"start":765.04,"duration":3.96,"text":"expose"},{"start":766.64,"duration":3.92,"text":"so that developers"},{"start":769.0,"duration":4.12,"text":"get to see"},{"start":770.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"as much as needed for their work."},{"start":773.12,"duration":6.08,"text":"Whereas platform engineer may work on"},{"start":776.0,"duration":3.2,"text":"various other layers."},{"start":780.76,"duration":4.6,"text":"Now, this is the Kubernetes exposure"},{"start":782.68,"duration":5.36,"text":"gradient which further tells us that"},{"start":785.36,"duration":4.92,"text":"things start at level one."},{"start":788.04,"duration":5.56,"text":"Now, at level one"},{"start":790.28,"duration":5.2,"text":"you are we have full control."},{"start":793.6,"duration":4.56,"text":"We are giving the full power of"},{"start":795.48,"duration":5.84,"text":"Kubernetes to everyone."},{"start":798.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"More work, more complexity exposed."},{"start":801.32,"duration":3.8,"text":"Then we standardized more. We said"},{"start":803.8,"duration":3.0,"text":"templates."},{"start":805.12,"duration":3.6,"text":"And templates"},{"start":806.8,"duration":3.2,"text":"solved the problem of knowing what to"},{"start":808.72,"duration":4.84,"text":"follow,"},{"start":810.0,"duration":6.6,"text":"but it was still too much of exposure."},{"start":813.56,"duration":5.68,"text":"But then golden paths, we said, which"},{"start":816.6,"duration":4.16,"text":"further reduce the complexity because"},{"start":819.24,"duration":4.24,"text":"you said that these are the treated"},{"start":820.76,"duration":5.56,"text":"paths, these are the safe known paths"},{"start":823.48,"duration":6.04,"text":"which developers should take."},{"start":826.32,"duration":4.16,"text":"And then comes the level of"},{"start":829.52,"duration":3.72,"text":"uh"},{"start":830.48,"duration":5.48,"text":"automation where it is at capabilities."},{"start":833.24,"duration":5.44,"text":"Level four is about where capabilities"},{"start":835.96,"duration":4.8,"text":"where most developers should sit."},{"start":838.68,"duration":4.6,"text":"Because they need to be exposed to as"},{"start":840.76,"duration":4.28,"text":"much as they need for their role or"},{"start":843.28,"duration":4.04,"text":"their work to be done."},{"start":845.04,"duration":4.64,"text":"They should not be worried about how"},{"start":847.32,"duration":4.56,"text":"does things happen in your engine below."},{"start":849.68,"duration":4.0,"text":"They should be expressing the intent and"},{"start":851.88,"duration":4.28,"text":"they should get what they want. So"},{"start":853.68,"duration":4.92,"text":"that's how the exposure model looks"},{"start":856.16,"duration":5.24,"text":"like."},{"start":858.6,"duration":5.4,"text":"And quickly the platform engineering 2.0"},{"start":861.4,"duration":6.44,"text":"architecture where"},{"start":864.0,"duration":5.84,"text":"developer speaks developer's language"},{"start":867.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"on the first layer."},{"start":869.84,"duration":4.36,"text":"Platform control plane translates it to"},{"start":872.68,"duration":4.8,"text":"the"},{"start":874.2,"duration":5.96,"text":"infrastructure language and does those"},{"start":877.48,"duration":5.44,"text":"automations and workflows for you."},{"start":880.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"And infrastructure engine gives you"},{"start":882.92,"duration":3.68,"text":"those facilities which is required."},{"start":884.6,"duration":3.76,"text":"Again, the exposure model. You're not"},{"start":886.6,"duration":3.64,"text":"exposing everything. You are"},{"start":888.36,"duration":5.4,"text":"giving developer what they want, what"},{"start":890.24,"duration":6.12,"text":"they speak, the capabilities."},{"start":893.76,"duration":4.92,"text":"Now, let's take a use case, platform"},{"start":896.36,"duration":4.24,"text":"engineering 2.0. Let's put it into"},{"start":898.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"action."},{"start":900.6,"duration":5.88,"text":"Let's say a developer needs a"},{"start":903.64,"duration":5.0,"text":"API inference service."},{"start":906.48,"duration":4.72,"text":"Now, what they should do is they should"},{"start":908.64,"duration":4.6,"text":"express the intent."},{"start":911.2,"duration":4.64,"text":"They should get all that workflow"},{"start":913.24,"duration":5.88,"text":"underneath prepared for you,"},{"start":915.84,"duration":5.2,"text":"prepared for them, sorry. And then you"},{"start":919.12,"duration":3.8,"text":"create the lean infrastructure what they"},{"start":921.04,"duration":4.64,"text":"need. That's how you can give them"},{"start":922.92,"duration":5.36,"text":"quickly. But how do you achieve it? I'm"},{"start":925.68,"duration":4.36,"text":"proposing here one particular stack, but"},{"start":928.28,"duration":3.4,"text":"actually this is not fixed. You can do"},{"start":930.04,"duration":3.88,"text":"your own permutation combinations and"},{"start":931.68,"duration":5.08,"text":"better than this. If you come up, please"},{"start":933.92,"duration":5.2,"text":"let me know also."},{"start":936.76,"duration":4.24,"text":"We are using here"},{"start":939.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"Okay, before I tell about those four"},{"start":941.0,"duration":3.8,"text":"things."},{"start":942.08,"duration":4.52,"text":"Now, this is something um we all have"},{"start":944.8,"duration":5.48,"text":"scars from."},{"start":946.6,"duration":6.92,"text":"50 plus name spaces, 20 plus CRDs,"},{"start":950.28,"duration":5.32,"text":"hundreds of services, all in one"},{"start":953.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"cluster or multi-tenants cluster in"},{"start":955.6,"duration":3.56,"text":"various forms, shared tenancy we have"},{"start":957.88,"duration":2.44,"text":"done."},{"start":959.16,"duration":3.84,"text":"But"},{"start":960.32,"duration":4.88,"text":"one runaway sidecar,"},{"start":963.0,"duration":6.32,"text":"one bad rollout,"},{"start":965.2,"duration":6.28,"text":"or one bad config map brings uh down the"},{"start":969.32,"duration":3.88,"text":"experience of developer experience for"},{"start":971.48,"duration":3.8,"text":"everyone."},{"start":973.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"How many of you have seen that with your"},{"start":975.28,"duration":2.48,"text":"work?"},{"start":977.96,"duration":4.28,"text":"Right? I've seen it. So"},{"start":980.08,"duration":5.48,"text":"can feel you."},{"start":982.24,"duration":5.56,"text":"Plus so platform 1.0 scaled the cluster."},{"start":985.56,"duration":4.8,"text":"In platform 2.0, we focused the"},{"start":987.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"capabilities."},{"start":990.36,"duration":3.92,"text":"Now,"},{"start":991.8,"duration":4.44,"text":"how do we achieve it?"},{"start":994.28,"duration":4.72,"text":"Instead of putting everything into one"},{"start":996.24,"duration":3.8,"text":"big messy cluster,"},{"start":999.0,"duration":5.0,"text":"we"},{"start":1000.04,"duration":5.92,"text":"give lean infrastructure by using KAS"},{"start":1004.0,"duration":4.64,"text":"K3S."},{"start":1005.96,"duration":4.48,"text":"K3S gives you those capabilities in form"},{"start":1008.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"of cells."},{"start":1010.44,"duration":5.04,"text":"Those cells can themselves be those"},{"start":1012.8,"duration":4.68,"text":"clusters which are spinned up by your"},{"start":1015.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"control plane."},{"start":1017.48,"duration":4.52,"text":"And because these clusters are"},{"start":1019.8,"duration":4.32,"text":"disposable,"},{"start":1022.0,"duration":3.24,"text":"if anything goes wrong, you can replace"},{"start":1024.12,"duration":2.96,"text":"them"},{"start":1025.24,"duration":3.52,"text":"and bring up the other one. Or if you"},{"start":1027.08,"duration":3.8,"text":"need to patch anything, you need to"},{"start":1028.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"upgrade anything, you can do those"},{"start":1030.88,"duration":4.6,"text":"replacements easily because you have"},{"start":1032.76,"duration":5.24,"text":"that lean infrastructure now."},{"start":1035.48,"duration":2.52,"text":"And"},{"start":1038.56,"duration":3.84,"text":"that's how you can also achieve the"},{"start":1040.44,"duration":6.12,"text":"resiliency which otherwise becomes a"},{"start":1042.4,"duration":6.0,"text":"problem with those uh heavy clusters."},{"start":1046.56,"duration":3.96,"text":"Next comes the"},{"start":1048.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"ambient mesh. Now, service mesh solved"},{"start":1050.52,"duration":3.96,"text":"real problem, but it came with heavy"},{"start":1053.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"tax."},{"start":1054.48,"duration":4.24,"text":"Tax of those sidecar injections, which"},{"start":1057.48,"duration":4.32,"text":"is a"},{"start":1058.72,"duration":4.16,"text":"with every pod you need a sidecar."},{"start":1061.8,"duration":3.36,"text":"Which"},{"start":1062.88,"duration":5.56,"text":"means that you need high CPU, more"},{"start":1065.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"latency, and more complexity operational"},{"start":1068.44,"duration":3.44,"text":"overhead again."},{"start":1069.88,"duration":3.4,"text":"Which ambient mesh,"},{"start":1071.88,"duration":3.32,"text":"or you can pick up your favorite"},{"start":1073.28,"duration":5.48,"text":"replacement of ambient mesh, but it"},{"start":1075.2,"duration":5.44,"text":"solves it by replacing it with a"},{"start":1078.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"different layers."},{"start":1080.64,"duration":5.92,"text":"This still gives the"},{"start":1082.84,"duration":5.16,"text":"same developers observability, routing"},{"start":1086.56,"duration":3.92,"text":"possibilities, and scaling"},{"start":1088.0,"duration":3.92,"text":"possibilities, but at a different layer."},{"start":1090.48,"duration":3.72,"text":"So, developer is"},{"start":1091.92,"duration":4.8,"text":"is doing just enough Kubernetes what it"},{"start":1094.2,"duration":2.52,"text":"needs."},{"start":1097.64,"duration":3.2,"text":"And the third piece of this puzzle is"},{"start":1099.2,"duration":2.68,"text":"gateway API."},{"start":1100.84,"duration":4.8,"text":"Now,"},{"start":1101.88,"duration":7.4,"text":"if my developer needs to have a canary"},{"start":1105.64,"duration":6.84,"text":"deployment, 10% of traffic routed,"},{"start":1109.28,"duration":4.16,"text":"it just needs to express that intent."},{"start":1112.48,"duration":3.12,"text":"And"},{"start":1113.44,"duration":4.28,"text":"gateway API and your control plane"},{"start":1115.6,"duration":5.88,"text":"platform control plane take cares of"},{"start":1117.72,"duration":5.52,"text":"that what below this pyramid, what all"},{"start":1121.48,"duration":4.44,"text":"lies your gateway, gateway class"},{"start":1123.24,"duration":4.4,"text":"configuration, and how it gets set up so"},{"start":1125.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"that you offer that"},{"start":1127.64,"duration":3.72,"text":"uh thing to the developer."},{"start":1132.0,"duration":4.68,"text":"In platform engineering 2.0,"},{"start":1135.32,"duration":4.32,"text":"we are not"},{"start":1136.68,"duration":5.52,"text":"just scaling, as I said, the clusters,"},{"start":1139.64,"duration":5.56,"text":"we are closing the loop."},{"start":1142.2,"duration":5.64,"text":"Because let's take one example. Let's"},{"start":1145.2,"duration":5.4,"text":"say Prometheus detected"},{"start":1147.84,"duration":5.08,"text":"that uh one of the memory is"},{"start":1150.6,"duration":4.0,"text":"having a memory growth in one of your"},{"start":1152.92,"duration":4.12,"text":"service."},{"start":1154.6,"duration":4.96,"text":"Now, it collects all those signals and"},{"start":1157.04,"duration":4.12,"text":"feeds it to your AI model or your"},{"start":1159.56,"duration":4.68,"text":"control plane."},{"start":1161.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"That control plane detects the anomalies"},{"start":1164.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"and inefficiencies."},{"start":1166.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"Very first thing"},{"start":1167.84,"duration":4.44,"text":"control plane does is it"},{"start":1170.4,"duration":4.44,"text":"separates out your"},{"start":1172.28,"duration":5.64,"text":"that cell or cluster."},{"start":1174.84,"duration":5.44,"text":"And then, it replaces it,"},{"start":1177.92,"duration":3.8,"text":"brings back the traffic to the newer"},{"start":1180.28,"duration":4.56,"text":"cluster."},{"start":1181.72,"duration":6.72,"text":"This is how we are closing the loop of"},{"start":1184.84,"duration":5.6,"text":"getting the things taken care as well as"},{"start":1188.44,"duration":6.48,"text":"the newer capabilities being offered"},{"start":1190.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"without going into all that hell."},{"start":1196.28,"duration":3.8,"text":"This is"},{"start":1197.64,"duration":5.52,"text":"what is the actual implementation of it"},{"start":1200.08,"duration":4.72,"text":"where user sits and expresses intent on"},{"start":1203.16,"duration":5.52,"text":"the top."},{"start":1204.8,"duration":6.2,"text":"Your right side is your shared managed"},{"start":1208.68,"duration":4.88,"text":"plane, which is giving you the gateway"},{"start":1211.0,"duration":4.56,"text":"API and the mesh capabilities and all"},{"start":1213.56,"duration":4.24,"text":"the networking possibilities what you"},{"start":1215.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"want to place there. These cells are"},{"start":1217.8,"duration":5.08,"text":"nothing but your mini clusters because"},{"start":1219.88,"duration":7.16,"text":"these are powered by K3s and K3s is"},{"start":1222.88,"duration":7.84,"text":"um like your full Kubernetes"},{"start":1227.04,"duration":5.6,"text":"capability, but without overexposing"},{"start":1230.72,"duration":5.04,"text":"things to the people."},{"start":1232.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"That's why it's lean and lightweight."},{"start":1235.76,"duration":3.48,"text":"And if anything goes wrong with one of"},{"start":1237.68,"duration":3.92,"text":"these services,"},{"start":1239.24,"duration":6.12,"text":"you can easily replace them."},{"start":1241.6,"duration":3.76,"text":"This is how we are putting it together."},{"start":1245.76,"duration":5.0,"text":"Now,"},{"start":1248.0,"duration":5.12,"text":"in platform engineering 2.0,"},{"start":1250.76,"duration":6.84,"text":"Kubernetes won the infrastructure war,"},{"start":1253.12,"duration":4.48,"text":"but it should not be the user interface."},{"start":1259.28,"duration":4.04,"text":"What What we need instead What we"},{"start":1261.72,"duration":4.52,"text":"achieve is"},{"start":1263.32,"duration":6.32,"text":"composed capabilities"},{"start":1266.24,"duration":5.48,"text":"and re- reduce cognitive load,"},{"start":1269.64,"duration":4.68,"text":"lean infrastructure,"},{"start":1271.72,"duration":5.4,"text":"which is what I'm calling as just enough"},{"start":1274.32,"duration":2.8,"text":"Kubernetes."},{"start":1278.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"Again, to reiterate, platform 1.0 scaled"},{"start":1281.36,"duration":6.8,"text":"the cluster,"},{"start":1283.16,"duration":7.8,"text":"platform 2.0 scales the capability."},{"start":1288.16,"duration":4.8,"text":"Hope that makes sense. I think with that"},{"start":1290.96,"duration":3.2,"text":"I'm done. I don't know how much time I"},{"start":1292.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"have."},{"start":1294.16,"duration":5.04,"text":"I still have 7 minutes I can see."},{"start":1297.4,"duration":4.04,"text":"If there are any questions, and before"},{"start":1299.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"that, if you don't mind, can I click a"},{"start":1301.44,"duration":2.96,"text":"pic with you all?"},{"start":1309.16,"duration":4.28,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1310.48,"duration":2.96,"text":"Any questions?"},{"start":1322.32,"duration":4.28,"text":"Any Yes, please. I have a question"},{"start":1324.28,"duration":6.16,"text":"regarding storage again."},{"start":1326.6,"duration":6.28,"text":"So, I didn't I saw you using CPU or GPUs"},{"start":1330.44,"duration":5.36,"text":"as a flexibility, but it you didn't talk"},{"start":1332.88,"duration":5.88,"text":"about the wanting to have file storage,"},{"start":1335.8,"duration":5.04,"text":"direct local storage."},{"start":1338.76,"duration":4.48,"text":"Is that not part of the equation, or"},{"start":1340.84,"duration":4.36,"text":"could you add that later?"},{"start":1343.24,"duration":3.04,"text":"It certainly is,"},{"start":1345.2,"duration":3.28,"text":"but"},{"start":1346.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"to keep the use case complexity to the"},{"start":1348.48,"duration":5.88,"text":"level where I've not brought the data"},{"start":1350.8,"duration":5.52,"text":"databases there. Even K3s can have it,"},{"start":1354.36,"duration":4.2,"text":"but you would part out those"},{"start":1356.32,"duration":4.2,"text":"functionalities to those cells which can"},{"start":1358.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"afford to be isolated. That's where"},{"start":1360.52,"duration":4.2,"text":"cell-based architecture works, right?"},{"start":1362.72,"duration":3.64,"text":"So, that made me not bring that into"},{"start":1364.72,"duration":4.72,"text":"this use case."},{"start":1366.36,"duration":3.08,"text":"But, it's pretty much there."},{"start":1371.52,"duration":4.96,"text":"Uh yeah. You want to ask on mic? I have"},{"start":1374.8,"duration":3.32,"text":"I have another question. Yes, please."},{"start":1376.48,"duration":5.96,"text":">> Um yeah."},{"start":1378.12,"duration":4.92,"text":"Uh apparently there is um organizations"},{"start":1382.44,"duration":3.88,"text":"um"},{"start":1383.04,"duration":5.64,"text":"that don't have a platform,"},{"start":1386.32,"duration":5.08,"text":"um, if they were here in the room, what"},{"start":1388.68,"duration":5.48,"text":"would you say to them and why should"},{"start":1391.4,"duration":5.88,"text":"they or should they not adapt platform"},{"start":1394.16,"duration":4.88,"text":"engineering? Thank you."},{"start":1397.28,"duration":3.52,"text":"Very good question. I think more people"},{"start":1399.04,"duration":3.76,"text":"should ask that. It's not necessary that"},{"start":1400.8,"duration":4.4,"text":"everyone needs a platform. It's a fancy"},{"start":1402.8,"duration":4.68,"text":"word these days, but the question you"},{"start":1405.2,"duration":4.68,"text":"should ask is that"},{"start":1407.48,"duration":4.8,"text":"um, is there anything"},{"start":1409.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"which can be made foundational which"},{"start":1412.28,"duration":3.88,"text":"makes people's life easier across the"},{"start":1414.72,"duration":3.56,"text":"company?"},{"start":1416.16,"duration":4.8,"text":"If answer is yes, maybe that's an"},{"start":1418.28,"duration":4.8,"text":"opportunity to start looking into what"},{"start":1420.96,"duration":4.12,"text":"is that and then"},{"start":1423.08,"duration":4.36,"text":"one way of easy way of solving it is"},{"start":1425.08,"duration":4.96,"text":"that, okay, automate it."},{"start":1427.44,"duration":4.48,"text":"But we need not label it as platform. If"},{"start":1430.04,"duration":4.6,"text":"you really feel that yes, you need"},{"start":1431.92,"duration":3.96,"text":"something which has to be abstracted out"},{"start":1434.64,"duration":3.08,"text":"and,"},{"start":1435.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"um, needs to be built as platform with"},{"start":1437.72,"duration":6.08,"text":"those five capabilities which I said,"},{"start":1440.72,"duration":4.92,"text":"then yes, why not? Because platforms, as"},{"start":1443.8,"duration":4.0,"text":"I said, are not just for systems. They"},{"start":1445.64,"duration":5.44,"text":"are for enabling the whole ecosystem. I"},{"start":1447.8,"duration":6.2,"text":"can give so many examples around it. You"},{"start":1451.08,"duration":5.44,"text":"use App Store or, um, these Galaxies,"},{"start":1454.0,"duration":5.4,"text":"right? So, it's it's Apple's way of"},{"start":1456.52,"duration":5.04,"text":"giving outside to the developers who"},{"start":1459.4,"duration":4.0,"text":"want to build on top of it. But they"},{"start":1461.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"would never say that Kubernetes"},{"start":1463.4,"duration":3.96,"text":"infrastructure cluster is installed in"},{"start":1465.72,"duration":3.52,"text":"so and so region."},{"start":1467.36,"duration":4.0,"text":"So, that's where they are. So,"},{"start":1469.24,"duration":3.6,"text":"figuring out, I mean, it's fancy just"},{"start":1471.36,"duration":3.08,"text":"because it's fancy you want to adopt it,"},{"start":1472.84,"duration":2.8,"text":"that's not the reason. But if you see"},{"start":1474.44,"duration":3.2,"text":"that there are"},{"start":1475.64,"duration":3.96,"text":"certain patterns in the company where"},{"start":1477.64,"duration":4.16,"text":"you have those opportunity, it is worth"},{"start":1479.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"looking in."},{"start":1481.8,"duration":2.44,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1485.48,"duration":2.52,"text":"Hi."},{"start":1486.28,"duration":3.56,"text":"So, my question is"},{"start":1488.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"for those of us who use managed"},{"start":1489.84,"duration":3.56,"text":"Kubernetes, EKS, AKS, that kind of"},{"start":1492.28,"duration":4.28,"text":"thing."},{"start":1493.4,"duration":5.96,"text":"How do you How do you propose"},{"start":1496.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"dynamically deploying K3S in places. Do"},{"start":1499.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"you run that as a pod inside your EKS"}